  "description": "Han Jae-hee, a personal shopper at DK Department Store, lives life to the fullest despite her difficult circumstances. Forced to become Kang-jun's dedicated shopper under the pretext of a lost customer item, she desperately tries to endure her harsh reality. Meanwhile, the inscrutable Kang-jun gradually digs deeper into Jae-hee's life.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854088), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14620782)",
